# This directory holds runtime Playwright artifacts (screenshots, traces, result JSON).
#
# Layout:
#   artifacts/<caseId>/before/screenshot.png
#   artifacts/<caseId>/before/trace.zip
#   artifacts/<caseId>/before/result.json
#   artifacts/<caseId>/after/screenshot.png
#   artifacts/<caseId>/after/trace.zip
#   artifacts/<caseId>/after/result.json
#
# Runtime-generated subdirectories are git-ignored (see .gitignore).
# Only pre-seeded demo artifacts for case-001 are committed.
# Served as static files by the API at http://localhost:3001/artifacts/
